;; Local reference oracle for amu (owner decision 2026-11-06, JUN-579).
;; One-off measurements on a developer machine only. Nothing here may enter CI,
;; a gate, a workflow, a build, packaging or a runtime path, and it is never a
;; fallback. A reference value is evidence of the reference's behavior, not proof
;; that the native route is correct; a mismatch is reported, not forced to agree.
;; Allowed languages: nbb, JVM, C, Python, Hy, jank, Fennel. .clj, .cljc and .cljs
;; live only under a project-root oracle/.
